\title{Plonky3}
\taxon{Tool}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2026-08-24}

[https://github.com/Plonky3/Plonky3](https://github.com/Plonky3/Plonky3)

\p{
    A STARK toolkit — [AIR](dhsorens-002U) plus [FRI](dhsorens-0037), configurable over field,
    hash, and PCS. The corpus treatment is
    [STARKs: Plonky3, Stwo, and Circle STARKs](dhsorens-003I). [Clean](dhsorens-002Y) has a
    proof-of-concept [backend](dhsorens-0050) that compiles a circuit to a Plonky3 AIR.
}
